    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_03",
      "hash64": "141BF63C57527E8F",
      "text": "AH ! Tu m’as fait peur ! J’étais tellement\\nconcentré que je t’ai pas vu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e débarquer ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_04",
      "hash64": "141BF33C57527976",
      "text": "Hé hé... Tu dois te dire que c’est rare d’me voir\\nbosser sérieusement comme ça...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_05",
      "hash64": "141BF43C57527B29",
      "text": "Mais c’est bon, j’crois que j’ai assez potassé pour\\naujourd’hui. Viens, on bouge ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_06",
      "hash64": "141BF13C57527610",
      "text": "Bienvenue dans la planque de Pepper et\\nDogrino ! Alors ? Qu’est-ce que t’en penses ?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_select_01",
      "hash64": "2DAE9F6978949394",
      "text": "Pas de doute, c’est bien ta chambre ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_select_02",
      "hash64": "2DAEA269789498AD",
      "text": "C’est plus propre que je l’imaginais ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_07a",
      "hash64": "7DF43E8861214846",
      "text": "N’est-ce pas ?\\nHé hé hé...\\r\\nEuh, attends... Qu’est-ce que t’insinues ?![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_07b",
      "hash64": "7DF43D8861214693",
      "text": "Comment ça, « plus propre que je l’imaginais » ?!\\nJ’fais le ménage tous les jours, j’te ferais dire !\\c\\nBon, c’est surtout pour balayer les poils que\\nDogrino laisse partout, mais quand même ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 192,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_08",
      "hash64": "141BFF3C57528DDA",
      "text": "Enfin bref... Je voulais te parler du truc que\\nj’étudiais en salle de classe, tout à l’heure.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_09a",
      "hash64": "7E245288614A8E04",
      "text": "En fait, je relisais le passage du Livre Écarlate\\nqui parle des Épices Secrètes...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_09b",
      "hash64": "7E245588614A931D",
      "text": "En fait, je relisais le passage du Livre Violet\\nqui parle des Épices Secrètes...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_10",
      "hash64": "141EFD3C5754C04B",
      "text": "Et j’me suis rappelé dans quel état était mon\\npauvre Dogrino quand il était encore malade...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_11",
      "hash64": "141EFC3C5754BE98",
      "text": "J’savais pas du tout quoi faire pour l’aider...\\nC’était un des moments les plus durs de ma vie.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_12",
      "hash64": "141EFF3C5754C3B1",
      "text": "J’ai vraiment eu d’la chance que tu sois là\\npour m’aider à trouver ces épices, mais...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_13",
      "hash64": "141EFE3C5754C1FE",
      "text": "J’peux pas être le seul à avoir vécu ça.\\c\\nJ’suis sûr qu’il y a plein d’autres gens comme moi\\nqui se sentent impuissants face à la souffrance de\\r\\nleur Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 162,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_14",
      "hash64": "141F013C5754C717",
      "text": "Alors, j’me suis dit...\\nEuh... Promets-moi de pas rire.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_15",
      "hash64": "141F003C5754C564",
      "text": "J’me suis dit que j’allais devenir cuistot ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_16",
      "hash64": "141F033C5754CA7D",
      "text": "J’veux concocter des recettes pleines de bons\\nnutriments pour redonner la forme aux Pokémon ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_select_03",
      "hash64": "2DAEA169789496FA",
      "text": "Je suis de tout cœur avec toi !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_select_04",
      "hash64": "2DAE9C6978948E7B",
      "text": "Je suis sûr[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e que tu peux le faire !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
